- The [38;5;10mdo {...} while ((exp_q2 -= e) > 0)[0m is a [38;5;10mloop[0m with the decrement and break at the bottom, so the body always runs at least once (which matters for [38;5;10mexp_q2 <= 0[0m, where it applies one scale factor and exits).[0m[0m
- [38;5;10m1 << 30 >> (e >> 2)[0m is integer arithmetic, converted to float only for the multiply. I kept the C operand order ([38;5;10mtable[e & 3] * scale[0m, then [38;5;10my *=[0m) so rounding is identical.[0m[0m
- For negative [38;5;10mexp_q2[0m, [38;5;10me >> 2[0m is negative and the C shift is undefined behavior. On the target hardware the shift count is masked to its low 5 bits, so I used [38;5;10mwrapping_shr[0m, which masks with [38;5;10m& 31[0m and reproduces that exactly rather than panicking or diverging.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
